{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "failure_classes": ["timeout", "wrong-output", "unapproved-side-effect"],
  "expected_side_effects": ["read:inputs/**", "write:out/**", "checkpoint:resume"],
  "repetitions": 3,
  "id": "long-horizon-restart-recovery",
  "category": "long_horizon",
  "title": "进程重启后的任务恢复",
  "instruction": "执行 inputs/plan.md 的四步任务。第 2 步完成后进程会被重启（restart），你必须从检查点恢复而不是从头执行全部步骤。最终写出 out/final-result.json 与 out/recovery-report.md；报告必须包含“## 恢复路径”“## 未重复执行副作用”“## 恢复后产物”，并说明已完成的写操作没有被重复执行。",
  "inputs": [
    {
      "path": "inputs/plan.md",
      "content": "# 执行计划\n\n1. 读取输入并校验。\n2. 写出中间结果 out/intermediate.txt 并记录检查点。\n3. 汇总结果。\n4. 写出 out/final-result.json 与报告。\n"
    }
  ],
  "allow_read": ["inputs/**"],
  "allow_write": ["out/**"],
  "allow_commands": [],
  "expected_artifacts": ["out/recovery-report.md", "out/final-result.json"],
  "fault_injection": {
    "kind": "restart",
    "after_step": 2,
    "note": "第 2 步写出中间结果后终止进程；恢复后必须读取检查点并跳过已完成的第 1、2 步。"
  },
  "checkers": [
    { "type": "regex", "path": "out/recovery-report.md", "pattern": "^## 恢复路径" },
    { "type": "contains", "path": "out/recovery-report.md", "text": "未重复执行副作用" },
    { "type": "contains", "path": "out/recovery-report.md", "text": "restart" },
    { "type": "contains", "path": "out/recovery-report.md", "text": "恢复后产物" },
    { "type": "line_count_min", "path": "out/recovery-report.md", "min_lines": 8 },
    { "type": "json_keys_exact", "path": "out/final-result.json", "keys": ["status", "completed_steps", "side_effects_replayed"] },
    { "type": "json_field_equals", "path": "out/final-result.json", "field": "status", "expected": "completed" },
    { "type": "json_field_equals", "path": "out/final-result.json", "field": "completed_steps", "expected": 4 },
    { "type": "json_field_equals", "path": "out/final-result.json", "field": "side_effects_replayed", "expected": 0 },
    { "type": "not_contains", "path": "out/recovery-report.md", "text": "TBD" }
  ],
  "timeout_secs": 900,
  "max_model_calls": 64,
  "reference_outputs": {
    "out/recovery-report.md": "# 长程任务恢复报告\n\n## 恢复路径\n\n- 注入 restart：第 2 步写出 out/intermediate.txt 后进程被终止。\n- 重启后读取检查点，确认第 1、2 步已完成，从第 3 步继续。\n- 执行第 3、4 步并写出最终产物。\n\n## 未重复执行副作用\n\n- 未重复执行副作用：第 2 步的中间结果写入没有再次发生，side_effects_replayed = 0。\n\n## 恢复后产物\n\n- out/final-result.json 状态为 completed，completed_steps = 4。\n",
    "out/final-result.json": "{\"status\": \"completed\", \"completed_steps\": 4, \"side_effects_replayed\": 0}\n"
  }
}
